 to stitch spans under a parent OTEL trace.\n- Wires `setContinuationTracer(...)` into `service.start()` (when `traces=true`) and `resetContinuationTracer()` into `stopStarted()` so the runtime returns to the additive Slice-1 noop on shutdown.\n- Re-exports the continuation-tracer registry surface from `src/plugin-sdk/diagnostics-otel.ts` so the bundled extension can install the adapter without crossing the package boundary.\n\n## Why\n\nSWIM-37 surfaced (F-37-010) that every `continuation.*` and `heartbeat` span emit-call from `agent-runner.ts` and `session-system-events.ts` was silently dropped through `noopTracer` in production: `setContinuationTracer` was exposed by the shim but never called from any production code path. The green-emit-gate masked the failure as feature-vapor.\n\nRefs: #334 (parent), F-37-010 (root cause). Unblocks SWIM-37 E2.x rows.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm test extensions/diagnostics-otel/src/continuation-tracer-adapter.test.ts` — 10 new adapter unit tests.\n- [x] `pnpm test extensions/diagnostics-otel/src/service.test.ts` — 23 tests pass, including 2 new install/uninstall lifecycle tests.\n- [x] `pnpm test src/infra/continuation-tracer.test.ts` — 71 tests still green.\n- [x] `pnpm test src/infra/system-events.test.ts` — 31 tests still green.\n- [x] `pnpm tsgo` + `pnpm tsgo:extensions` + `pnpm check:test-types` — clean.\n- [x] `pnpm build` — clean; `plugin-sdk:api:check` baseline unchanged.\n\n## Constraints honored\n\n- No changes to call sites in `agent-runner.ts` or `session-system-events.ts`.\n- No changes to the `Tracer` interface in `src/infra/continuation-tracer.ts`.\n- Adapter lives in `extensions/diagnostics-otel/src/` keeping `@opentelemetry/api` inside the plugin. No new root deps.","created_at":"2026-04-29T01:50:39Z","updated_at":"2026-04-29T01:50:39Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url"